Description: Helps you imagine your data before you collect it. Builds a data
    frame one column at a time, with hierarchical levels, cross-classified
    levels, potential outcomes, and draws with a target intra-cluster
    correlation, so that a research design can be simulated and diagnosed
    before any data exist. Version 2.0 is a rewrite of the same public API on
    dplyr, tibble, purrr, and rlang.
